sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Service
    participant I as IDM
    participant P as Credential provider (GOV.UK One Login or Government Gateway)
    S->>B: Redirect to IDM's authorisation endpoint
    B->>I: Authorisation request
    alt No live session
        I->>B: Send the user to the credential provider
        B->>P: The user authenticates
        P->>B: Return the user to IDM
        B->>I: Authenticated user
    else Live IDM session
        I->>B: Single sign-on page, with no sign-in page
    end
    I->>B: Organisation picker
    B->>I: The user picks an organisation, or IDM picks the only one
    I->>B: Redirect to the service's registered redirect address with a one-time code
    B->>S: One-time code
    S->>I: Token request with the code and the client secret
    I->>S: ID token, an access token when the scope holds the client ID, and a refresh token when it holds offline_access
